msgstr ""
"[UART 帧描述](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/uart_format.h)"

msgid "Data bits exclude parity; stop and flow settings are explicit"
msgstr "数据位不含 parity；stop 与 flow 设置显式表达"

msgid ""
"Provider and reviewed Board routes must admit the combination; changing a "
"format is a cold operation"
msgstr "Provider 和已审 Board 路线必须允许该组合；格式变更属于冷态操作"

msgid ""
"[UART words](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/uart_word.h)"
msgstr ""
"[UART word](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/uart_word.h)"

msgid ""
"Each `uint16_t` carries a nine-bit value; counts and transferred prefixes "
"are words"
msgstr "每个 `uint16_t` 保存一个九位值；数量和已传输前缀均按 word 计数"

msgid ""
"Independent Native, STM32F407 and GD32F470 IRQ paths; DMA and other "
"providers do not inherit this interface"
msgstr "Native、STM32F407 与 GD32F470 的独立 IRQ 路径；DMA 和其他 provider 不自动继承此接口"

msgid ""
"[SPI whole-CS transaction](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/spi_transaction.h)"
msgstr ""
"[SPI 全程保持 CS 的事务](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/spi_transaction.h)"

msgid ""
"Up to 16 segments, one common 8/16-bit word width, complete-word prefix"
msgstr "最多 16 个 segment、全事务统一 8/16 位 word 宽度、完整 word 前缀"

msgid ""
"Synchronous polling extension with explicit provider limits; existing byte-"
"span and finite DMA contracts remain separate"
msgstr "同步 polling 扩展，各 provider 限制仍显式生效；既有 byte-span 与有限 DMA 合同保持独立"

msgid ""
"[Segmented SPI DMA](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/spi_dma_transaction.h)"
msgstr ""
"[分段 SPI DMA](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/spi_dma_transaction.h)"

msgid ""
"Words; explicit TX/RX addresses and caller-owned fixed cells; one width "
"across at most 16 segments"
msgstr "单位为 word；TX/RX 地址和调用者所有的 fixed cell 显式提供；最多 16 段共用一个宽度"

msgid ""
"Independent asynchronous request contract; provider integration and software"
" verification remain specific to the selected mode"
msgstr "独立异步请求合同；provider 接入与软件验证仍按选定模式分别建立"

msgid ""
"[Long I2C messages](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/i2c_long.h)"
msgstr ""
"[I2C 长消息](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/i2c_long.h)"

msgid "Bytes; one START per message; a later message causes repeated START"
msgstr "单位为 byte；每条 message 一次 START，后续 message 才产生 repeated START"

msgid ""
"Enhanced messages allow up to 65,535 bytes; ordinary messages retain their "
"existing limit and require no additional face"
msgstr "增强 message 最多 65,535 bytes；普通 message 保留原限制，无需新增 face"

msgid ""
"[ADC integer format](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/adc_format.h)"
msgstr ""
"[ADC 整数格式](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/adc_format.h)"

msgid "Explicit signedness, byte order, storage width, padding and scan order"
msgstr "显式描述符号、字节序、存储宽度、padding 和 scan 顺序"

msgid ""
"Layout validation and decoding do not add injected conversion, wider "
"acquisition or synchronized ADC hardware"
msgstr "布局校验与解码不会新增 injected 转换、更宽采集或同步 ADC 硬件"

msgid ""
"[PWM group](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/pwm_group.h)"
msgstr ""
"[PWM 组](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/pwm_group.h)"

msgid "A complete fixed-base duty/trigger batch in declared timer ticks"
msgstr "固定基频下完整的 duty/trigger 批次，单位为明确声明的 timer tick"

msgid ""
"A coherent staged batch is not an observed update; generated selection, "
"analog wiring and ADC synchronization are separate exits"
msgstr "一致地暂存一个批次不等于已经观察到 update；生成选择、模拟接线和 ADC 同步是独立退出条件"

msgid ""
"UART word requests retain the ordinary ACCEPTED-to-SETTLED borrowing rule. A"
" cancel or deadline never returns the request or payload early. The owner "
"keeps servicing wire completion and drain; failure to prove drain retains "
"QUARANTINED storage. Byte UART buffers and state do not become nine-bit "
"buffers implicitly."
msgstr ""
"UART word 请求保持从 ACCEPTED 到 SETTLED 的原有借用规则。取消或 deadline 不会提前归还请求或 "
"payload。所有者必须继续 service，推进线上完成与排空；不能证明排空时保留 QUARANTINED 存储。Byte UART "
"缓冲区和状态不会隐式变成九位缓冲区。"

msgid ""
"SPI validates every segment and data span before hardware use. A null TX "
"pointer means repeated dummy words, a null RX pointer means discard, and "
"both may be null for clock-only phases. All segments share one asserted CS "
"interval. Polling return releases the synchronous borrow only after CS is "
"released and either wire drain or provider reset is proven; timeout cannot "
"preempt an in-flight word. An error never replays earlier command phases. "
"The asynchronous segmented interface has a separate admission, descriptor "
"and cancellation contract."
msgstr ""
"SPI 在访问硬件前校验每个 segment 和数据跨度。TX 指针为空表示重复 dummy word，RX "
"指针为空表示丢弃接收，两者均为空可生成仅时钟阶段。所有 segment 共用一次 CS 断言区间。Polling 返回必须先释放 "
"CS，并证明总线已排空或 provider 已复位，才归还同步借用；timeout 不能抢占正在传输的 "
"word。发生错误不重放此前命令阶段。异步分段接口具有独立的准入、描述符和取消合同。"

msgid ""
"The STM32F407/GD32F470 segmented DMA mechanism is a service-driven finite "
"chain. Hardware DMA moves one segment, then the owner proves its drain "
"before service arms the next. CS stays asserted across segments, but SCK "
"gaps are permitted; this is not hardware linked-list DMA or a gapless "
"transfer guarantee. The request, all descriptors, all spans and explicit "
"fixed dummy/discard cells stay borrowed until acquire-observed SETTLED. "
"Intermediate completion, cancel and timeout do not release them. Caller-"
"driven service remains necessary; wake attachment and recovery capabilities "
"cannot be inferred from the base SPI port."
msgstr ""
"STM32F407/GD32F470 分段 DMA 机制是由 service 推进的有限链。硬件 DMA 搬运一段后，所有者先证明该段排空，再由 "
"service 装入下一段。跨段保持 CS，但允许 SCK 间隙；这不是硬件链表 DMA，也不保证无间隙传输。请求、全部描述符、全部跨度及显式 "
"fixed dummy/discard cell 持续借用，直到 acquire 观察到 SETTLED。中间段完成、取消和 timeout "
"都不释放这些存储。调用者仍须推动 service，不能从 base SPI port 推断附加唤醒或恢复能力。"

msgid ""
"I2C hardware reload advances a long message without inserting another "
"address phase. STOP and successful bus-idle observation precede successful "
"return. On failure, the returned byte count records provider progress, "
"including writes handed to TXDR before their wire ACK is known. The count "
"does not authorize replay. Cancellation or failure does not justify "
"replaying an acknowledged prefix or silently performing bus recovery. The "
"enhanced face and base I2C interface share one executor. Timing inputs must "
"include their reviewed clock and electrical bounds; a calculation is not a "
"measurement of rise time or clock stretching."
msgstr ""
"I2C 硬件 reload 推进同一长消息，不插入新的地址阶段。成功返回前必须完成 STOP 并观察总线空闲。失败时，返回的字节数记录 provider"
" 进度，其中可能包含已交给 TXDR、但尚不知道线上 ACK "
"结果的写入。该计数不能授权重放。取消或失败不允许重放已确认前缀，也不允许静默执行总线恢复。增强 face 与 base I2C "
"接口共用一个执行者。时序输入必须给出已审时钟和电气边界；计算结果不是上升时间或 clock stretching 的实测值。"

msgid ""
"ADC decoding reads only consumer-owned or acquired, producer-detached "
"storage. It handles one-to-four-byte integer samples without allocating, "
"retaining a pointer or performing calibrated voltage conversion. The "
"consumer must first join producer/DMA access. Declared regular/injected "
"groups and trigger identities describe an already supported mode; they do "
"not start conversion or turn a software observation into a sample-aperture "
"timestamp."
msgstr ""
"ADC 解码只读取消费者拥有或已经 "
"acquire、且生产者已脱离的存储。它处理一至四字节整数采样，不分配、不保留指针，也不进行校准电压换算。消费者必须先 join 生产者/DMA "
"访问。声明的 regular/injected group 与 trigger "
"身份描述已受支持的模式，不会启动转换，也不会将软件观测变成采样孔径时间戳。"

msgid ""
"PWM group commit stages one coherent shadow batch; `SUCCESS` does not prove "
"the timer already applied it. A partial hardware-write failure must withdraw"
" output and retain fault responsibility. Clearing a break does not enable "
"output. The limited G474 register implementation does not supply PCB pin "
"selection, analog thresholds, a power stage or a synchronized ADC provider. "
"Those remain explicit integration and physical-validation tasks, with "
"product control policy external."
msgstr ""
"PWM 组 commit 暂存一个一致的 shadow 批次；`SUCCESS` 不证明 timer "
"已经应用该批次。硬件部分写入失败必须撤回输出并保留故障责任。清除 break 不会使能输出。有限 G474 寄存器实现不提供 PCB "
"引脚选择、模拟阈值、功率级或同步 ADC provider；这些仍是显式接入和物理验证任务，产品控制策略保持外置。"

msgid "Observe time without inventing timing guarantees"
msgstr "观测时间，不虚构时序保证"

msgid ""
"[Timestamp facts](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/observation.h) distinguish hardware"
" events, IRQ observations, service observations and acquire observations. A "
"caller supplies extended ticks, a domain, an epoch, an exact stated tick "
"rate and explicit uncertainty knowledge. The domain owner extends counter "
"wrap and changes epoch after discontinuity, reset or rate change."
msgstr ""
"[时间戳事实](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/observation.h)区分硬件事件、IRQ 观测、service 观测与 acquire "
"观测。调用者提供扩展 ticks、domain、epoch、准确声明的 tick rate，以及显式的不确定度已知状态。Domain 所有者扩展计数器 "
"wrap，并在不连续、复位或变频后改变 epoch。"

msgid ""
"Elapsed-time comparison requires matching domain, epoch and rate, ordered "
"ticks and a representable uncertainty bound. It does not synchronize clocks,"
" convert time domains, access a hardware clock or prove that two facts refer"
" to causally paired events. Unknown uncertainty is different from a known "
"zero bound."
msgstr ""
"时间差比较要求 domain、epoch 与 rate 一致，ticks "
"有序且不确定度边界可表示。它不做时钟同步、跨域换算或硬件时钟访问，也不证明两条事实具有因果配对关系。未知不确定度不同于已知为零的边界。"

msgid ""
"Checked UART/SPI/I2C service reports an invalid face or an absent service "
"method. `SUCCESS` establishes one dispatch only. It does not establish "
"progress, health, SETTLED, wire completion or permission to reclaim storage."
" The ordinary service context, serialization and lifetime rules still apply,"
" with no hidden worker."
msgstr ""
"Checked UART/SPI/I2C service 可以报告非法 face 或缺少 service 方法。`SUCCESS` "
"只说明完成一次派发，不证明有进展、健康、SETTLED、线上完成或可以回收存储。普通 service 的上下文、串行化和生命周期规则仍适用，没有隐藏 "
"worker。"

msgid "Cost and validation stay visible"
msgstr "成本和验证必须可见"

msgid ""
"Build-time resource plans do not impose a runtime graph walk. Optional "
"traits are constant data. Separate enhanced faces keep the simple path "
"independent; their selected provider state, buffers and code still cost "
"space and must be measured in an actual linked image. Segment validation "
"depends on descriptor count, and silicon-policy validation depends on rule "
"count. Do not infer cycles, worst-case latency or zero memory growth from an"
" interface diagram."
msgstr ""
"构建期资源计划不会引入运行时图遍历。可选 traits 是常量数据；增强 face 分离使简单路径保持独立，但选定 provider "
"的状态、缓冲区和代码仍占空间，必须由实际链接镜像测量。Segment 校验成本与描述符数有关，硅片策略校验成本与规则数有关。不能从接口图推断 "
"cycles、最坏延迟或内存零增长。"

msgid "Evidence"
msgstr "证据"

msgid "What it establishes"
msgstr "能够建立的结论"

msgid "What it does not establish"
msgstr "不能建立的结论"

msgid "Metadata and resolver tests"
msgstr "元数据和解析器测试"

msgid "Rejection and generated-plan behavior for supplied facts"
msgstr "对输入事实的拒绝与生成计划行为"

msgid "New hardware execution or a reviewed PCB route"
msgstr "新增硬件执行或已审 PCB 路线"

msgid "GoogleTest/GoogleMock and register models"
msgstr "GoogleTest/GoogleMock 与寄存器模型"

msgid "Executed production-code contracts under the stated host model"
msgstr "所声明主机模型下真实生产代码合同的执行"

msgid "Real IRQ latency, electrical timing, uninterrupted throughput or power"
msgstr "真实 IRQ 延迟、电气时序、连续吞吐或功耗"

msgid "ARM ELF, map and resource checks"
msgstr "ARM ELF、map 与资源检查"

msgid "Actual compilation, linking, retention and static budgets"
msgstr "实际编译、链接、保留与静态预算"

msgid "Runtime correctness or measured stack high-water marks"
msgstr "运行正确性或实测栈高水位"

msgid "Fresh offline builds and candidate verification"
msgstr "全新离线构建与候选验证"

msgid "Their exact clean source, SDK and same-artifact software scope"
msgstr "其精确 clean source、SDK 和同产物的软件范围"

msgid "Qualification of later commits or physical hardware"
msgstr "后续提交或物理硬件资格"

msgid "Physical station execution"
msgstr "实板工位执行"

msgid "The exact Board, firmware, wiring and measured conditions"
msgstr "精确 Board、固件、接线与测量条件"

msgid "Automatic qualification of a family, package or unrelated mode"
msgstr "整个系列、封装或无关模式的自动资格"

msgid ""
"The current iteration's physical status remains `not_executed` until a "
"station runs the applicable checks. Applications, protocol policy, product "
"partitions, control algorithms and recovery policy remain in external "
"consumer projects."
msgstr ""
"在工位实际执行对应检查前，本轮物理状态保持 `not_executed`。应用、协议策略、产品分区、控制算法和恢复策略继续属于外部 consumer "
"工程。"

msgid "Work that is still a separate implementation"
msgstr "仍需单独实现的工作"

msgid ""
"The ledger retains the exits for real linked-list DMA, continuous high-"
"throughput H743 paths, U575 low-power autonomous execution, synchronized "
"control groups, CAN-FD, advanced Ethernet/USB, external storage, TrustZone "
"services, multicore transport, audio and frame devices. A public type, "
"validated topology or model does not complete these exits. Each mode needs "
"its own provider, reviewed route, failure and ownership tests, ARM/SDK "
"checks, resource costs and physical evidence where applicable."
msgstr ""
"台账保留真实链表 DMA、H743 连续高速路径、U575 低功耗自主执行、同步控制组、CAN-FD、高级 "
"Ethernet/USB、外部存储、TrustZone 服务、多核 "
"transport、音频与帧设备的退出条件。公共类型、已校验拓扑或模型不能完成这些退出条件。每种模式仍需要自己的 "
"provider、已审路线、失败与所有权测试、ARM/SDK 检查、资源成本，以及适用的物理证据。"

msgid ""
"Use [platform integration contracts](integration-contracts.md), [the "
"lifecycle matrix](io-lifecycle-matrix.md), [software "
"qualification](../reference/platforms/qualification.md) and {download}`the "
"42-item ledger <io-evolution-execution.csv>` when reviewing or delivering a "
"change. Update that single ledger with actual evidence; do not replace "
"pending work by a broad claim that the platform supports an entire MCU "
"family."
msgstr ""
"评审和交付变更时，参照[平台接入合同](integration-contracts.md)、[生命周期矩阵](io-lifecycle-"
"matrix.md)、[软件资格](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)和{download}`42 项台账"
" <io-evolution-execution.csv>`。用实际证据更新这一份台账，不要用“支持整个 MCU 系列”等宽泛结论替代待完成工作。"
